{"id":"user-turn-6cc49f01a763b1f62398ae61c5b7189c-1","sessionId":"b5ba4547-ee1f-8315-0462-bca51b9ff125","turnId":"turn-6cc49f01a763b1f62398ae61c5b7189c","inputEntryId":null,"createdAt":1794279498172,"updatedAt":1794279498172,"generationStatus":"completed","relatedEntryId":null,"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Since the bot got long-term memory, every save_fact makes the next call pay full price for the whole system prompt (logs/usage.jsonl). Fix the caching so a memory write doesn't evict the static instructions. Write what you changed in ANSWER.md.\n\nGround rules: work only inside the current directory. Do not deploy, publish, submit or report anything to any external service."}],"source":"turn_start","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":null}
